            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/test-events",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "test-events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Generate events for testing analytics flows, such as webhooks.\nThis endpoint can be used to create one or more SlashID events. The request body is a list of test event descriptions, including the type of event to generate, the number of events of that type to generate, and whether those events should be duplicates. The contents of the events will be randomly generated, and will have the `is_test_event` flag set to true, so they can be distinguished from real events.\nPlease refer to our events guide for a full list of SlashID events and their contents.\nNote that this endpoint is rate-limited to 10 test events per minute, with a burst of 50. If your tests require a higher rate, please contact us."
          },
